    <string name="how_to_play_title">How to Play</string>
    <string name="how_to_play_text">REACTION DUEL (2 players)
1. Player 1 holds a finger on the left half, Player 2 on the right half.
2. After a random delay, the screen flashes \"GO!\" - the first player to lift their finger wins the point.
3. Lifting before \"GO!\" is a false start and an automatic loss of the round.

Play a set number of rounds (Quick, Best of 3/5/7). Points carry over between rounds and whoever has the most when the match ends is crowned Champion (ties share the title).

FINGER PICKER - Single Pick
1. Everyone places a finger anywhere on the screen - no need to say how many people are playing first.
2. Once fingers stop arriving for a moment, the app locks in and spins through everyone before landing on one at random.
3. Pick a purpose before you start - Who Pays, Who\'s It, Goes First, Truth or Dare, or write your own - and the winner is announced by number.

FINGER PICKER - Full Order
Works just like Single Pick, but instead of stopping after one winner, it keeps spinning and picking fingers one at a time until everyone has a rank - handy for turn order, team drafts, or deciding a whole night\'s chore rotation in one go.</string>
